# The build context is the repository root. The image is built from the server and the packages its bundle holds:
# core, the mail providers, the dashboard and the connector. The dashboard and the connector carry the design
# system's output in their own generated sources (src/generated/assets.ts, src/ui/design.generated.ts), so design/
# isn't needed. Everything else stays out: the apps, the design package, the command-line tool, the docs, tests,
# the scripts that regenerate those sources, local data and secrets. docker-entrypoint.sh is the image's entry point;
# LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md go into the image beside the server.
*
!core/
!server/
!mail/
!dashboard/
!mcp/
!docker-entrypoint.sh

**/node_modules
*/dist
*/test
core/scripts
dashboard/scripts
dashboard/assets
mcp/scripts
**/*.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
**/.DS_Store
**/data
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.key
**/*.tsbuildinfo
